<?xml version="1.0"?>
<Fleet xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <Name>OSPN 30 Minutes</Name>
  <Version>3</Version>
  <TotalPoints>3000</TotalPoints>
  <FactionKey>Stock/Protectorate</FactionKey>
  <Description>Difficulty: &lt;color=orange&gt;FULL TIME WORK&lt;/color&gt;

It's a CVLN. I mean, it's a CVLN without Cudas, in this house we use pikes. But it's a CVLN. Hit stuff with your cork torps, win. Use bombs to finish stuff up in a single sortie. Gunpods are way better than you think when you load HE (load HE).
  </Description>
